Full Flow Example

git init                                # अगर repo local में नया है
git add .                               # सभी files add
git commit -m "first commit"            # commit message
git branch -M main                      # branch को main नाम देना
git remote add origin https://github.com/username/repo.git
git push -u origin main                 # first push with branch set

git push origin main --force


# Git clone make 
git clone https://github.com/username/repo.git

# Next Steps After Clone
cd mytest             # Clone किए गए folder में जाएं
git status            # Repo की current स्थिति देखें
git branch            # Current branch देखें

# Agar naya GitHub repository set karna hai
origin ko update kar dijiye:
git remote set-url origin https://github.com/digitalsamer/telemedcineWithMemership.git
Phir verify karein:
git remote -v
Aur push karein:
git branch -M main
git push -u origin main

# Ya purana origin remove karke dubara add karein
git remote remove origin
git remote add origin https://github.com/digitalsamer/telemedcineWithMemership.git
Phir:
git push -u origin main


1️⃣ Merge the Whole Branch
# Switch to your target branch (where you want changes)
git checkout main

# Merge the other branch into it
git merge feature-branch


/// Abhi bhi purani commit history branch me maujood hai. Chaliye usse completely remove karte hain. //

PowerShell me ye commands exactly chalao:
git log --oneline --all

Mujhe lag raha hai output me kuch aisa hoga:
d698e91 Remove OpenAI API key and use env variable
8231755 Initial commit

Ab hume secret wali commit ko history se hata kar nayi clean branch banani hai.

Step 1: Orphan branch banao
git checkout --orphan clean-main

Step 2: Saari files stage karo
git add .

Step 3: Naya clean commit banao
git commit -m "Initial clean commit"

Step 4: Purani main branch delete karo
git branch -D main

Step 5: Current branch ko main naam do
git branch -m main

Step 6: Force push karo
git push -u origin main --force


